<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/lu_43204eb005113090db3476895a76cc14f70698fd23b8582928d6dd3b8f43e10b_n0036/tu_0003> <http://digistrucmed.org/verbatimText> "Flecainide\nAntiarrhythmic (Class IC)\nC\nYes\nYes\nb\nInadequate human data\nAnimal data:\n• teratogenic effects (e.g. club paws, sternebral and vertebral abnormalities, pale hearts with contracted ventricular septa) and an embryotoxic effect (e.g. increased resorptions) in one breed of rabbit (New Zealand White) but not in another (Dutch Belted) (4× MRHD)\n• no teratogenic effects in rats or mice (at 50 and 80 mg/kg/day, respectively), but delayed sternebral and vertebral ossification at high dose in rats" .
